This product includes the configuration glue (docker-compose.yml,
Caddyfile, .env.example) for assembling a self-hosted Open WebUI +
Langfuse v3 + Caddy proof-of-concept stack. It bundles no source code
of the upstream components themselves.

The Docker images referenced from docker-compose.yml are produced and
distributed by their respective upstream projects under their own
licenses, summarized below for attribution. Each image's full license
text ships inside the image and on the linked project page.

